  sequenceId: area_3_npc_1
  lines:
  - speakerName: NPC 1
    text: 'Hi!.

      This is an introduction level to the game!.

      I''m an
      NPC and i can communicate to you through dialogue!. (click next to continue)'
  - speakerName: NPC 1
    text: Sometimes I will give you quest, sometimes i will give you item to aid
      your adventure!
  - speakerName: NPC 1
    text: Most of the time, I will give you piece of information about the story!
